{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage your own goblin shop. Craft unique weapons and negotiate their price! Send out explorers to gather resources and become the richest merchant in the kingdom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a goblin who has finally decided to open your own weapons shop:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and decorate your shop tile by tile!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and buildings through mini-games! Each weapon will have a value based on its rarity.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haggle with every customer and make a fortune! (As a true goblin should)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire explorers and send them on missions around the world. After a few days, they will return with valuable resources and new recipes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be able to grow from a small workshop to the most famous armory in the land?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039680?t=1765025722","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4039680?t=1765025722","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039680/30ac144f98ae4ffdba5f5d1dcbd0b9a7687219c2/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1765025722","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4039680/30ac144f98ae4ffdba5f5d1dcbd0b9a7687219c2/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_0.jpg?t=1765025722","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and manage